  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Install:</strong> Clinic<br>\n<strong>Cost:</strong> 1000</p>\n<p>Cyberware Enhancement. The first time a Netrunner fails to Breach the Passwall provided by a Self-ICE with this enhancement, the Netrunner must roll another Interface Check (1d10+Interface) against the target’s WILL (1d10+WILL) to remain stealthily Jacked In. If the Netrunner fails this check, the user of a Canary Self-ICE is aware of the Netrunner's intrusion and gains a +2 bonus on their next check to Jack Out the intruding Netrunner.</p>\n<p><strong>Enhances:</strong> Self-ICE</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Self-ICE is from official R. Talsorian material (Edgerunners Mission Kit) that Cyberpunk RED - Core does not include, so there is no Self-ICE item to install this in. Keep it in the inventory as a record.</li>\n<li>The extra Interface Check is not automated.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From Bontari Homebrew Cyberpunk Items by Bontari (Cyberware).</em></p>"
  },
